  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="8507367b-f348-550f-9d0c-1b5beaeba426" activityNameId="35574a12-ee88-58f1-8640-09cea3906ffe" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in cogen 15kWth</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in cogen 15kWth
Inventory for 1 MJ natural gas (Hu), burned in a cogeneration plant with a capacity of 15 kWth. This inventory reflects the unallocated process of burning natural gas in a cogen unit with all necessary inputs and emissions. Efficiency of the cogen unit as well allocation is not yet considered;
UUID: 3b83b35d-187f-30be-a730-961c58a743d6
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (cogeneration plant), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: Average technology available on the market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: Some emissions are extrapolated from natural gas, burned in boiler 15kW
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3b83b35d-187f-30be-a730-961c58a743d6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
